WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.790
Is your tech stack slowing you down?

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.490
This is Sam. Registered manager.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.270
Awake before the alarm. Again.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.930
Four systems. Four passwords.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.190
One very slow colleague.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.130
Her phone keeps her chained to her desk.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.650
She missed the school play.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.370
And an inspection always felt one bad day away.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.050
Something had to give.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.730
Switching scared her most.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.210
It didn't need to.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.200
We move your data for you.

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.600
Most agencies are up and running within seven

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.350
days of sending us their data.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:56.570
Then one Monday, everything was simply in one place.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.120
Now, when a carer calls in sick at dawn, the cover

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.230
is found before the kettle's boiled.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:07.250
And the office line finds her, wherever she is.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.680
Her carers arrive ready, knowing exactly who they're

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:16.630
going to see.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.390
Between visits, there's time to breathe.

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:28.510
Families feel close, even from miles away.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.960
And when the inspector calls, every record is

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.490
right where it should be.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.700
More of her budget goes back into care, and into

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.530
her team.

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.890
And her team feels like a team again.

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:51.190
And this time, she's in the front row.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:56.810
Evenings are hers again.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.570
This is your great reset.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:09.610
HomecareOS. Start 2027 refreshed and ready to care.
